<td rowspan=2 width=40><br></td><td valign=top nowrap><font color="#669D6D"><b>祝辞ありがと</b></font>　<b>Sgy</b> - <small>2001/04/09(Mon) 17:58</small> <font color="#669D6D"><small>No.14</small></font></td><td valign=top nowrap> &nbsp;  </td><td valign=top>
<br></td>
</tr></table><table border=0 cellpadding=5><tr>
